# Warm LUT for the AgentCut grading example: a gentle red lift and
# blue pull-back. LUT_3D_SIZE 2, red fastest, then green, then blue.
TITLE "AgentCut warm example"
LUT_3D_SIZE 2
0.05 0.00 0.00
1.00 0.00 0.00
0.05 1.00 0.00
1.00 1.00 0.00
0.05 0.00 0.90
1.00 0.00 0.90
0.05 1.00 0.90
1.00 1.00 0.90
